"VR Karts: Sprint", "keywords": ["vr", "karts", "racing", "arcade", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "The checkered flag is about to drop on an exciting Virtual Reality racing experience! \nGet in the drivers\u2019 seat and race against other opponents in your own customized kart. Race through stunning tracks, collect power ups and use weapons to gain the upper hand over other racers. \n\nVR Karts is a fun and approachable Virtual Reality racing game.\nLet\u2019s race! \n\nFeatures: \nSingle Player racing experience \nChampionship Trophy Mode \nOnline multiplayer mode \nKart customization \nA host of different weapons to slow down your opponents \nSpeed pickups to boost you to the finish line", "short_description": "VR Karts is an adrenaline-fuelled arcade racing game designed for Virtual Reality"}]}, "developer_name": "Viewpoint Games Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.viewpointgames.co.uk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.viewpointgames.co.uk/terms", "publisher_name": "Viewpoint Games Ltd", "support_website_url": "https://www.viewpointgames.co.uk/contact", "website_url": "http://www.vrkarts.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "RACING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "33374193898894331"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v